>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `set_flag`

``` hol4
HOLFlags.set_flag : flag * int -> unit
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Set an integer-valued flag.

A call to `set_flag (f, i)` sets the flag `f` to `i`. Flags created
with a maximum of one are better reached through `set_bflag`, which
presents them as booleans.

### Failure

Fails if `i` is negative, if it exceeds the maximum fixed when the flag
was created, or if `f` does not name a trace.

